-- currently this nested temporal operator is not supported
context Elevator
inv betweenAndPatternFalse: (isCalled(move()) and sometime isCalled(closeDoor()))
    implies always (isCalled(closeDoor()) implies sometime isCalled(move()) before isCalled(openDoor()))

